  "scope": "Read-only post-run comparison; no source edits, fixture reruns, relabeling or API calls.",
  "finding": "Experiment p4 target identity is not portable when output is inside the repository.",
  "mechanism": "The execution command omits an explicit pytest rootdir. Hosted output resides under the repository and pytest emits repository-relative qualified JUnit classnames. The probe hardcodes test_probe::test_target and test_probe::control. These keys are absent, so the native classifier returns not_exercised and target_observation is null. known_defect_reproduced requires BOTH native and work classifiers to say detected, producing zero despite the work classifier reproducing the fault.",
